<title>UK: RANK BUYS BACK 500,000 SHARES AT 344P/SHR.</title>
<headline>RANK BUYS BACK 500,000 SHARES AT 344P/SHR.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British leisure company Rank Group Plc said on Monday it had bought back 500,000 ordinary shares for cancellation at 344 pence each.</p>
<p>Rank said it bought the stock from BZW Securities Ltd and NatWest Securities Ltd.</p>
<p>Last week, Rank said it would start to buy back up to 83.6 million shares or 10 percent of its issued share capital.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
